      "statusChangeNewStatus": "available in future release",
      "value": "Please ensure that you have height-mode selected on the \"Avatar Measurement\" toggle button, and that you have set your real physical height to your \"User Real Height\" setting.\nThen please try again in the latest beta build. 11946+ will have a change that will make a slight improvement to knee behavior for small avatars like yours.",
